+* **Report and figures**: CC BY 4.0, attribution to Jasco Francis John, Ardhi University.
+* **Data**: not covered by either licence; the raw data belong to their owners and are not redistributed. World Bank WDI snapshots are CC BY 4.0. Aggregates derived from restricted data follow `docs/data_terms.md`.
